     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2462403751');});}); #rec2462403751 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462403751 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2462403751 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462403751 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Audioinstrument AXLE 2/V2 Streamer Total*: $1500 Buy Now   Perfect Matches This high-performance network transport is engineered for bit-perfect digital audio deployment. To eliminate systemic noise and achieve the ultimate analog-like presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Digital Streamer  +   Gerbera Sound "Solero" Network Switch  +   Gerbera Tube Master Clock  +   Art&Air Digital Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF per each item added.     Key Features Specification Digital Outputs Local Storage     Proprietary ARC OS Architecture The foundation of the AXLE 2/V2's performance is its operating system. ARC OS is not a generic computer OS; it is a stripped-down, hyper-optimized environment where only the exact code required for bit-perfect audio transmission is allowed to execute. This guarantees zero software-induced jitter and total black backgrounds. Every background process, graphic interface, and non-essential service has been surgically removed to minimize CPU latency and eradicate electrical noise. Furthermore, the critical digital output software algorithms have been custom-written by a highly acclaimed Dutch audio engineer. Network integration is handled via a dedicated RJ-45 Ethernet input, while output to your DAC can be configured via pristine Coaxial S/PDIF, I2S, or dedicated Audio-USB protocols. Dutch Engineering Pedigree The critical software managing the digital output stage was uniquely authored by a prominent Dutch digital audio engineer. This bespoke coding bypasses standard kernel mixers, ensuring the data stream arriving at your DAC is exactly identical to the source file, bit-for-bit. Seamless App Integration There are no clunky native interfaces to navigate. The Arca acts as a pure UPnP/DLNA renderer. You maintain full, fluid control using your favorite third-party control apps on iOS or Android (such as BubbleUPnP, mConnect, or Audirvana), effortlessly sending Tidal, Qobuz, or local files directly to the streamer. Operation is entirely "headless" and effortlessly managed via standard UPnP/DLNA interfaces using popular smartphone/tablet applications such as BubbleUPnP or mConnect. The Arca natively supports bit-perfect streaming from high-resolution services like Qobuz and Tidal, as well as direct local playback from smartphones or an optional internal Solid State Drive (SSD).         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.   Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section).   Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes the stock device with no additional options.  Operating SystemProprietary ARC OS (Audio-Optimized) Network Input1x Gigabit Ethernet (RJ-45) Digital OutputsCoaxial S/PDIF / I2S (HDMI/RJ45) / Dedicated Audio-USB Control InterfaceUPnP / DLNA via Smartphone/Tablet Apps (BubbleUPnP, mConnect, etc.) Streaming SupportNative integration for Tidal, Qobuz, Web Radio Local PlaybackDirect stream from mobile devices or optional internal Solid State Drive (SSD) Output SoftwareCustom-authored digital transport coding by Dutch audio engineering Warranty1 Year Comprehensive Factory Warranty         USB Type A   Coaxial S/PDIF   Coaxial S/PDIF + I2S (HDMI Type)         Stock 300GB Internal Storage   1TB Samsung PRO Solid State Drive (SSD) for Local Library   2TB Samsung PRO Solid State Drive (SSD) for Local Library   4TB Samsung PRO Solid State Drive (SSD) for Local Library       
