     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2462135561');});}); #rec2462135561 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462135561 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2462135561 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462135561 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Audioinstrument Sirius KT150 Tube Amplifier Total*: $4500 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Aesthetics Component Upgrades     Pure Class A Triode Performance The Sirius KT150 bypasses the common limitations of conventional push-pull designs by running its output stage in pure Class A triode mode. Backed by a shallow, non-invasive 3 dB global negative feedback loop, it offers an incredibly clean, fluid, and transparent acoustic window into your recordings, preserving micro-dynamics with absolute fidelity. A standout characteristic of the Sirius KT150 is its exceptionally low output impedance of approximately 1.2 Ohms.  Absolute Genre Universality The unique circuit architecture translates to punchy, authoritative control that refuses to be constrained by musical genres. From grand operatic performances and massive symphonic orchestras to aggressive heavy metal and complex electronic transients, this amplifier handles it all. Yet, when playing intimate jazz or acoustic arrangements, it renders vocals with the same delicate, palpable tenderness found in elite single-ended Class A topologies. Elite Driver and Preamp Stage To feed the massive KT150 tetrodes, the preamp and driver stages utilize an exceptional combination of 6SL7 tubes for voltage amplification paired with iconic 6V6 (6P6S) tubes in the driver stage. Input routing across the 4 available source channels is electronically switched via precision low-noise relays, while the volume attenuation is anchored by a legendary ALPS potentiometer from Japan. This allows for seamless electrical matching with virtually any modern or vintage loudspeaker, resulting in tight, authoritative, and perfectly defined low-frequency bass response. The premium metal chassis is finished with a specialized heat-resistant paint coating and sealed with a crystal-clear gloss lacquer. This protective layer preserves the striking industrial design while ensuring effortless maintenance and long-term durability.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the Audioinstrument Sirius KT150 Tube Amplifier with no additional options Operating ModePure Class A Triode Output TubesKT150 (Power Tetrodes) Driver Stage Tubes6V6 / 6P6S Pre-Amplifier Tubes6SL7 Maximum Output Power20 W per channel Nominal Output Power15 W per channel Frequency Response20 Hz – 25 kHz (-1.0 dB) Output Impedance1.2 Ohms Recommended Load4 - 8 Ohms (6 Ohms optimal) Input Sensitivity0.775 V Global Negative FeedbackShallow (3 dB) THD (at Nominal Power)0.1% THD (at Maximum Power)≤ 3.0% Inputs4 switchable inputs (Relay controlled) Dimensions (W x H x D)430 x 350 x 200 mm Weight20 kg Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Classic Black Gloss Lacquer  Cherry-Silver Gloss Lacquer         Stock High-Quality Tube Configuration   Premium NOS Matched KT150 Tube Quartet   Vintage NOS 6V6 & 6SL7 Signal Tubes Upgrade  ALPS Blue Velvet Premium Volume Potentiometer      
