     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2463196441');});}); #rec2463196441 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463196441 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2463196441 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463196441 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Audioinstrument VIVO Amplifier Total*: $1800 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Transistor Stage     Tube-Like Acoustic Signature The VIVO is specifically voiced for listeners who crave the lush, holographic midrange of vacuum tubes but prefer the plug-and-play convenience of a solid-state unit. The amplifier completely avoids the dry, clinical sound often associated with transistors, offering instead a fluid, organic, and highly engaging musical experience. Dual-Mono Power & Active Protection Stability and separation are guaranteed by a dual-mono power supply, allocating a separate heavy-duty transformer to each audio channel. To ensure the absolute safety of your valuable loudspeaker investments, the VIVO is equipped with an integrated soft-start circuit and an active speaker protection relay system. Premium Control Topology Signal attenuation is managed by a legendary Japanese ALPS motorized potentiometer, offering perfectly balanced volume adjustments from the comfort of your listening chair. Input routing across the 4 available channels is entirely relay-switched, ensuring the shortest, cleanest possible signal path from source to amplification. Sonically, the VIVO possesses a remarkably soft and melodic acoustic signature. The midrange is highly informative and rich, closely mimicking the presentation of a high-end vacuum tube amplifier. The upper registers are rendered with crystalline clarity, entirely free of harsh sibilance or "digital grit," while the low-end delivers powerful, authoritative bass impact. The output stage can be configured with either modern high-performance SANKEN transistors or vintage Germanium transistors for an even warmer vintage tone.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
