865239"]{display:table;left:calc(50% - 320px + 20px);width:603px;}#rec2362923131 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"] .tn-atom__slds-img{background-size:cover;}}@media screen and (max-width:639px){#rec2362923131 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"]{display:table;top:21px;left:calc(50% - 240px + 21px);width:439px;height:315px;}#rec2362923131 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"] .tn-atom__slds-img{background-size:cover;}}@media screen and (max-width:479px){#rec2362923131 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"]{display:table;left:calc(50% - 160px + 21px);width:278px;height:224px;}#rec2362923131 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"] .tn-atom__slds-img{background-size:cover;}}         Demograf Audio Equipment "Ajax" — Class A EL-84 / 6B4G Tube Integrated Amplifier for Headphones & Speakers  The Demograf "Ajax" is a versatile, reference-grade single-ended Class A tube integrated amplifier powered by your choice of EL-84, 6B4G, ECL-82, or PCL-82 vacuum tubes. Engineered to deliver a unique, highly expressive sound signature, this amplifier effortlessly drives both dynamic and low-impedance planar magnetic headphones (such as Sennheiser HD-800, Fostex TH-900, Audeze LCD-2, Dan Clark Ether Flow) as well as high-sensitivity loudspeakers, providing 3W of pure, highly detailed Class A power.    function updatePrice() {let modelSelect=document.getElementById('model-select');let basePrice=parseInt(modelSelect.value);document.querySelectorAll('.opt-check:checked').forEach(cb=>{basePrice+=parseInt(cb.getAttribute('data-price'));});document.getElementById('price-display').innerText=basePrice;}
function checkout() {let finalPrice=document.getElementById('price-display').innerText;let modelSelect=document.getElementById('model-select');let modelName=modelSelect.options[modelSelect.selectedIndex].getAttribute('data-name');alert("Вы выбрали: " + modelName + ". Итоговая цена: $" + finalPrice + ". Переход к оформлению...");} .product-wrapper{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;padding:20px;}.label-name{font-size:18px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;}.label-def{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:5px;}.label-def p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.6;}.label-def p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}.label-select{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:5px;}.product-type{margin-bottom:12px;}.product-type select{padding:12px;width:100%;max-width:300px;font-size:14px;}.opt-check{transform:scale(1.2);margin-right:12px;cursor:pointer;}.option-item{display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:15px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;}.total-price{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin:20px 0;color:#333;}.buy-button{padding:16px 25px;background:#b38b59;color:#fff;border:none;cursor:pointer;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;}        t_onFuncLoad('t396_initialScale',function() {t396_initialScale('2362923131');});t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t396_init',function() {t396_init('2362923131');});});           Demograf Audio Ajax EL-84 Tube Amplifier for Headphones & Fullrange Speakers Total*: $5000 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Stage Input Tubes Kenotron Tubes Output Tubes Component Upgrades Inlet & Outlets Aesthetic Options    AC Input Inlet (Power Input on Device)   Standard Spec: IEC C14 Chassis Input   Heavy-Duty Spec: IEC C20 High-Current Inlet   AC Output Sockets (Regional Form Factors)   European Standard: Schuko (Type F)  US / Japan Standard: NEMA 5-15R (Type B)   British Standard: BS 1363 (Type G)   Universal Interface: Direct IEC C13 Outlets   Contact Grade   Stock Pure Copper Unplated i.e. MSound MS-06(Cu) etc. (Organic & Balanced Tone)   Gold Plated Contacts e.g. Furutech FI-09(G) etc. (Warmth & Rich Mid-range Texture)   Rhodium Plated Contacts Furutech FI-09(R) etc. (Maximum Transient Speed & Detail)          Unique, Expressive Tube Sound The "Ajax" amplifier gives you the flexibility to choose between EL-84, 6B4G, ECL-82, or PCL-82 output tubes. It serves as an accessible yet highly refined gateway to true audiophile listening, extracting maximum emotion, detail, and natural warmth from your music collection. Versatile Headphone & Speaker Matching Perfectly suited for flagship dynamic headphones (Sennheiser HD-800, Fostex TH-900, Audio-Technica W5000) and low-impedance planar magnetics (Audeze LCD-2, Dan Clark Ether Flow). It also drives sensitive loudspeakers (from 8 ohms / 100 dB or 16 ohms / 95 dB) with astonishing ease and musicality. External PSU & Clean Architecture To eliminate unwanted noise and interference from dirty electrical grids, the Ajax employs a dedicated external power supply featuring tube rectification (kenotron), galvanic isolation, heavy-duty transformers, capacitors, and premium chokes. A dedicated Ground Lift switch ensures absolute silence in any setup. Featuring a classic chassis paired with an external kenotron power supply, galvanic isolation, and premium components, the Ajax ensures dead-silent operation and breathtaking acoustic realism, completely free from electrical grid interference.           Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.   Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section).   Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes The amplifier features RCA inputs, speaker terminals, as well as 6.3mm and XLR headphone outputs, alongside a ground lift switch. It comes in a classic chassis with an external power supply featuring a rectifier tube, galvanic isolation, power transformers, capacitors, resistors, chokes, and premium wiring for even better sound performance and interference-free operation in the most unstable electrical grids:
                 Rectifier tube: 6D22S (6Д22С) Input tubes: 2 x 6J4 (6Ж4) Output tubes: 2 x 6B4G (6Б4Г) Volume control: ALPS potentiometer Amplifier inputs: RCA Headphone outputs: 6.3mm TRS, 4-pin XLR Speaker outputs: Binding posts Ground lift: Toggle switch    Amplifier ClassPure Class A Output Power3 Watts per channel at 8 Ohms (Push-Pull version with double power available on request) Supported Impedance8 Ohms (Optional: 4 Ohms / 16 Ohms customization) Channels2 (Stereo) Output Tubes2x 6B4G (6Б4Г) (optionally - EL-84 and any other similar tubes) Input Tubes2x 6Zh4 (6ж4) or other types optionally e.g. EL-8 / ML-6 etc. Rectifier Tube (Kenotron)2x 6D22S (6д22с) for a warmer/darker tone or 1x 5C3S (5ц3с) for a brighter signature (option) Volume ControlALPS or as an opition - Custom stepped attenuator by Demograf Audio Equipment InputsAnalog RCA (Optional: Balanced XLR) Internal WiringProprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy wire (other options available) Headphone Outputs1x 6.3mm TRS, 1x XLR 4-pin (Optional: 2.5mm, 3.5mm, 4.4mm Pentaconn, dual XLR 3-pin, or Electrostatic/EST connector) Speaker OutputsStandard binding posts or optionally - plugs by Demograf Audio Equipment Special FeaturesGround Lift switch (selectable ground loop isolation) DimensionsFrom 450 x 450 x 250 mm Weight (with PSU)From 45 kg / 99 lbs Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Stock: Single-Ended (classic detailed sound)  Push-Pull (for x2 output power, huge & more massive analog MF, LF)        Stock: 6zh4 soviet tubes  EL-8 Valvo for more detailed sound   AL-4 for more heavy bass and MF   EF-14 for more authentic MF e.g. Opera / Symphonic music  ML-6 for more neutral sound        Stock: 6d22s for darker sound  5c3s for brighter sound  Other Type        Stock: 6B4G (6Б4Г)  Stock: EL-84  Stock: ECL-82  Stock: PCL-82  Other similar Tubes        Stock: No extra options  Boutique Capacitors Suite (Duelund, Mundorf, Miflex etc.)  Custom Flagship Transformers & Chokes (Tango, Tamura, Hashimoto, etc.)  Silver AMRG Resistors & Premium Cardas Wiring Kit  High-End Connectors Suite (e.g. Furutech Top-Tier plugs)  Solid-core Copper Speaker Connectors  Premium Solid-core Copper Connectors with Galvanic Gold/Silver Plating  Vintage Tubes  Integrated Tone Control Block Module / Filter  Transformer taps for 4 or 16 Ohms (additional winding)  Bi-wiring integration supplement  Tri-wiring integration supplement  Additional 1 Analog RCA Input  Additional 1 Analog XLR Balanced Input  Demograf High-End Swiss-Stepped Pre-Amp (similar to Stevens & Billington tx103)   Variable GAIN Control Module  4.4mm Pentaconn Output Termination  Dedicated STAX Electrostatic Output Interface  Fully Balanced XLR Amplifier Architecture  On-the-fly Pentode / Triode Operational Mode Toggle Switch  Additional Reserve Matched Pair of low-emission Tubes        Stock: Standard Configuration  Fast-track production (+50% of Total Price)  Precision-Milled Metal Chassis  CNC milling  Contoured Bent-Metal Enclosure  Exotic Hardwood Chassis  Glass-Integrated Aesthetic  Premium Wood Inlays & Accents  Solid-Billet Metal Enclosure  Advanced Galvanic Finishing  Custom Dimensions & Form Factor  Parameter Status Display  Multifunction Remote Control Suite  Protective tube cage (child & pet safety)      
