ce:nowrap;background-size:cover;}}@media screen and (max-width:479px){#rec2343487981 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780237765591000003"]{display:table;left:calc(50% - 160px + 174px);width:auto;height:auto;}#rec2343487981 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780237765591000003"] .tn-atom{white-space:nowrap;background-size:cover;}}         Demograf Audio "Andromeda" Acoustic Speaker Cable  The "Andromeda" is a highly reliable, reference-grade acoustic speaker cable crafted by Demograf Audio, designed to provide the ultimate connection between your power amplifier and loudspeakers. By default, the Andromeda features our proprietary "RareCoreFusion" conductor—a highly classified matrix of selected materials.    .product-wrapper{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;padding:20px;max-width:600px;}.label-name{font-size:20px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;color:#333;font-weight:bold;}.label-def{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#555;}.label-def p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.6;}           t_onFuncLoad('t396_initialScale',function() {t396_initialScale('2343487981');});t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t396_init',function() {t396_init('2343487981');});});           Demograf Audio Andromeda Speaker Cable Total*: $1450 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Conductor Material Connectors Type Connectors Grade Cable Length     The History These conductors were originally utilized in the manufacturing of highly sophisticated equipment and have a proven track record in advanced technological projects, particularly within the Soviet aerospace, space exploration, and defense industries. This is premium-grade solid-core copper sourced from the very heart of Russia. We utilize only high-quality, authentic solid-core copper, a true testament to the legendary industrial standards of the former Soviet Union. The "RareCoreFusion" Foundation The standard Andromeda cable is built around Demograf Audio's signature proprietary alloy. This unique metallurgical blend provides maximum detail retrieval, exceptional accuracy, and a three-dimensional soundstage, ensuring minimal signal loss and interference. The RareCoreFusion includes solid-core copper, secret acoustic additives, and rare-earth elements that delivers a phenomenally detailed and transparent sound signature. We offer absolute flexibility. The Andromeda can be ordered with entirely custom conductor geometries—including Copper/Gold alloys, pure Silver, Litz matrices, or Silver/Gold/Phosphorus blends. Combined with your choice of premium spades or banana plugs, this cable allows you to perfectly tune the sonic character to your specific acoustic room and listening preferences. Endless Customization We understand that every audio chain is unique. For discerning listeners, we offer fully bespoke conductor manufacturing. You can request customized cross-sections, complex fine-braiding, solid-core or multi-core architectures, and exotic materials such as Copper + Gold, pure Silver, Litz, or Silver + Gold + Phosphorus alloys to perfectly color and tune the sound to your exact taste. Perfect Room Integration Gone are the days of dealing with excessively long, protruding, or awkwardly short acoustic cables behind your audio rack. With our highly precise length customization (available in 25cm increments), you can order a cable that perfectly fits your room and equipment stand. Protected by a premium fabric braided sleeve, the Andromeda combines durability with sleek aesthetics.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the stock 2.5m cable with standard banana connectors and no additional options.  ManufacturerDemograf Audio Model"Andromeda" Reference Acoustic Speaker Cable Standard ConductorProprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy Custom ConductorsCopper/Gold, Litz, Pure Silver, Silver/Gold/Phosphorus (Upon Request) Outer SleeveHigh-quality fabric braid (Custom materials available) Standard Length2.5 meters (Stereo Pair) Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Stock: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy  Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating      Loudspeaker Terminations (Amplifier & Speaker Ends)   Stock: No Connectors: Bare Wire with Crimp  Bananas Plugs  Premium Spades      Hardware Termination Grade   Stock: High-Quality Copper Connectors  Ultimate: Premium Flagship Hardware (e.g. Furutech, WBT)         Standard Cable Length (2.50 m)
