und compared to analog or power cables, they are the critical final step in a high-end setup. The Asteria ensures that you extract every ounce of capability from your digital sources, providing a rock-solid, jitter-free bridge to your DAC. Exotic Conductor Architectures We offer absolute flexibility for your digital chain. The Asteria can be ordered with entirely custom conductor geometries—including Copper/Gold alloys, pure Silver, Litz matrices, or Silver/Gold/Phosphorus blends. Paired with your choice of premium digital connectors (Coaxial, AES/EBU, USB, etc.), it perfectly fine-tunes the sonic resolution to your exacting standards. For audiophiles seeking to calibrate their sound signature, Demograf Audio provides tailored configurations. Depending on your system requirements, we can implement varying core counts, fine-braided structures, or complex metallurgy—including ultra-pure Silver runs or Silver+Gold+Phosphorus configurations—to provide precise tone-matching and layered stage separation. Bespoke Room Integration Eliminate loose, dangling, or uncomfortably taut cabling runs behind your gear. The Asteria features highly versatile custom manufacturing, adjustable in clean 10cm steps from a baseline of 0.5 meters. Wrapped in a premium fabric braided shield, it delivers excellent mechanical isolating damping along with an elegant aesthetic presentation.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the stock 0.5m cable with standard connectors with no additional options.  ManufacturerDemograf Audio Model"Asteria" Reference Digital Cable Standard ConductorProprietary "RareCoreFusion" Multi-Element Alloy Custom Conductor RunsCopper/Gold, Pure Silver, Silver/Gold/Phosphorus (To Order) Outer IsolationPremium fabric sleeve damping (Custom options available) Standard Length0.5 meter Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Stock: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy  Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating      Digital Interface Standard   Stock: S/PDIF Coaxial (RCA to RCA)  BNC Cable  AES/EBU (XLR 3-pin Digital)  USB Audio (Type A to Type B)  I2S (HDMI format)      Hardware Termination Grade   Stock: High-Quality Copper Connectors  Ultimate: Premium Flagship Hardware (e.g. Furutech)         Standard Cable Length (0.50 m)
