table;left:calc(50% - 240px + 23px);width:433px;height:276px;}#rec2345401341 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"] .tn-atom__slds-img{background-size:cover;}}@media screen and (max-width:479px){#rec2345401341 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"]{display:table;top:11px;left:calc(50% - 160px + 11px);width:303px;height:208px;}#rec2345401341 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780133865239"] .tn-atom__slds-img{background-size:cover;}}         Cassiopeia AMT Ribbon Supertweeters (Matched Pair)  The "Cassiopeia" represents the absolute frontier in high-frequency extension, designed as an auxiliary supertweeter system for the most demanding audiophiles. Utilizing advanced Air Motion Transformer (AMT) pleated ribbon technology, these drivers squeeze air rather than pushing it, resulting in a transient speed that traditional dome tweeters simply cannot replicate. With an ultra-low mass diaphragm and staggering performance metrics, the Cassiopeia completely eliminates high-frequency breakup distortion     .product-wrapper{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;padding:20px;max-width:600px;}.label-name{font-size:20px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;color:#333;font-weight:bold;}.label-def{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#555;}.label-def p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.6;}        t_onFuncLoad('t396_initialScale',function() {t396_initialScale('2345401341');});t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t396_init',function() {t396_init('2345401341');});});           Cassiopeia AMT Ribbon Supertweeters Total*: $990 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Tweeters type Impedance Sensitivity      The Air Motion Transformer (AMT) Edge Unlike conventional ribbon or dome tweeters, the Cassiopeia utilizes a pleated polyethylene diaphragm lined with aluminum conductors. As an audio signal passes through, the folds instantly compress and expand, forcing air out at a velocity significantly faster than the driver's actual physical movement. This results in lightning-fast transient response, immaculate micro-dynamics, and a crystalline clarity that lets music breathe naturally.  Unlocking Holographic Space Why implement a dedicated supertweeter? Human hearing perceives high-frequency harmonics far beyond nominal textbook limits to determine spatial borders, instrument placement, and room ambience. The Cassiopeia extends your acoustic system's high-frequency envelope, anchoring a true three-dimensional soundstage and introducing an organic "live venue" texture to vocals, strings, and cymbal decays. Flawless Crossover Integration A supertweeter must blend imperceptibly with your main loudspeakers rather than dominate them. By offering precise hardware taps for varying nominal impedances (4, 6, or 8 Ohms) alongside laboratory-sorted sensitivity configurations from 87 dB to 95 dB, the Cassiopeia integrates flawlessly into your system's final voice, regardless of your main speaker topology.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
