e:cover;}}@media screen and (max-width:479px){#rec2343441011 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780237765591000003"]{display:table;left:calc(50% - 160px + 174px);width:auto;height:auto;}#rec2343441011 .tn-elem[data-elem-id="1780237765591000003"] .tn-atom{white-space:nowrap;background-size:cover;}}         Demograf Audio "Pollux" Analog Interconnect Cable  The "Pollux" is a high-performance, reference-grade analog interconnect cable crafted by Demograf Audio, designed to optimize signal transmission between premium source components. By default, the Pollux utilizes our proprietary "RareCoreFusion" conductor—a highly classified matrix combining specialized coppers, secret acoustic additives, and rare-earth elements.    .product-wrapper{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;padding:20px;max-width:600px;}.label-name{font-size:20px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;color:#333;font-weight:bold;}.label-def{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#555;}.label-def p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.6;}           t_onFuncLoad('t396_initialScale',function() {t396_initialScale('2343441011');});t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t396_init',function() {t396_init('2343441011');});});           Demograf Audio Pollux Interconnect Total*: $1100 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Conductor Material Input Connectors Output Connectors Connectors Grade Cable Length     The History These conductors were originally utilized in the manufacturing of highly sophisticated equipment and have a proven track record in advanced technological projects, particularly within the Soviet aerospace, space exploration, and defense industries. This is premium-grade solid-core copper sourced from the very heart of Russia. We utilize only high-quality, authentic solid-core copper, a true testament to the legendary industrial standards of the former Soviet Union. The Critical Component Link Analog interconnects are second only to power cables in terms of systemic impact. By establishing a correct, mathematically sound link between your DAC, preamplifier, and power stage, the Pollux preserves the fragile signal voltages, ensuring an ink-black noise floor and superb micro-detail parsing. Exotic Conductor Architectures For audiophiles seeking to calibrate their sound signature, Demograf Audio provides tailored configurations. Depending on your system requirements, we can implement varying core counts, fine-braided structures, or complex metallurgy—including ultra-pure Silver runs or Silver+Gold+Phosphorus configurations—to provide precise tone-matching and layered stage separation. This structural layout minimizes transmission anomalies, offering a perfectly cohesive, musical, and lifelike presentation. We provide comprehensive bespoke configuration options. The Pollux can be built using custom solid-core or multi-core runs of Copper+Gold, pure Silver, Litz matrices, or complex Silver+Gold+Phosphorus blends. Paired with fine fabric braiding and your choice of input/output connectors, it serves as the ultimate tool to tune your system's final voice. Bespoke Room Integration Eliminate loose, dangling, or uncomfortably taut cabling runs behind your gear. The Pollux features highly versatile custom manufacturing, adjustable in clean 10cm steps. Wrapped in a premium fabric braided shield, it delivers excellent mechanical isolating damping along with an elegant aesthetic presentation.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the stock 1m cable with standard RCA connectors and no additional options. ManufacturerDemograf Audio Model"Pollux" Reference Interconnect Cable Standard ConductorProprietary "RareCoreFusion" Multi-Element Alloy Custom Conductor RunsCopper/Gold, Pure Silver, Silver/Gold/Phosphorus (To Order) Outer IsolationPremium fabric sleeve damping (Custom options available) Standard Length1.0 meter Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Stock: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy  Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Proprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy + Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core  Custom: Pure Silver Solid-Core + Gold Galvanic Plating      Input Connectors (From Source Component)   Stock: RCA Plugs (Standard Unbalanced)  XLR Plugs (Balanced)  5-pin DIN Connector (Phono)      Output Connectors (To Amplifier)   Stock: RCA Plugs (Standard Unbalanced)  XLR Plugs (Balanced)      Hardware Termination Grade   Stock: High-Quality Copper Connectors  Ultimate: Premium Furutech Connectors         Standard Cable Length (1.00 m)
