     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2457701301');});}); #rec2457701301 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457701301 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2457701301 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457701301 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Filin Audio Limited Isodynamic Closed Headphones Total*: $2500 PRE-ORDER NOW   Perfect Matches These 91dB sensitive planar magnetic closed headphones reveal their true dynamics and holographic imaging with authoritative amplification and high-resolution conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Filin Audio Limited  +   Eridan Antares R2R DAC  +   Demograf Nemesis Solid-State Amplifier  +   Demograf Anthea Headphone Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF per each item added.     Key Features Specification Tuning & Customization Component Upgrades Cable Output Plug Cable Length      General Description Limited Bundle Includes: carrying case, stock solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition), Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval. The Filin Audio "Limited" utilizes isodynamic (planar magnetic) drivers consisting of a thin membrane with embedded conductive traces, suspended between two arrays of bar magnets. Because the voice coil is evenly distributed across the entire surface of the membrane, it moves uniformly over its entire area during music playback. Unlike traditional dynamic drivers, where the coil only drives the center of the cone, this isodynamic design ensures highly balanced, flat, and extremely precise audio reproduction without unwanted coloration. Inside these headphones are special membranes crafted by Sergey Snorry, meticulously tuned by master Evgeny Melentiev. Exceptional Passive Noise Isolation! The "Limited" features a circumaural (over-ear) monitor design. This is the most sophisticated and advanced headphone form factor, boasting a large headband and fully encompassing ear cups. This allows the integration of a massive membrane that effortlessly reproduces the entire frequency spectrum. The headphones are equipped with isodynamic drivers engineered and manufactured by Sergey Snorry specifically to Filin Audio's exact specifications, featuring patented tubular waveguide technology (SAW Technology®). Inside, the wiring will be made of custom 2.8mm² solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade high-purity silver, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets. The headphones come with a detachable copper cable to enhance treble and midrange detail, and deliver a punchier bass line. The ear cups are milled from fully dried, premium-grade, ultra-hard exotic woods. Wood waste (sawdust) accounts for about 70%, which serves as a testament to the uncompromisingly strict selection of suitable raw materials. The headphones feature unique, custom-designed ear pads that are entirely hand-stitched.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.   Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section).   Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes the headphones, carrying case, stock solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition) with standard connectors (4-pin XLR output and mini xlr inputs), Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval with no additional options.   Acoustic Principle Closed-back Headphones   Headphone Type Planar Magnetic (Isodynamic)   Driver Type and Quantity Planar Magnetic (Isodynamic), 2 pcs. by Snorry Isodynamic with modifications of Evgeny Melentiev   Driver Modifications Enlarged ear cups and driver flanges; center offset forward and downward for perfect ear canal alignment; special tuning via sophisticated acoustic waveguides   High-Tech Technologies SAW Technology®   Impedance, Ohm 35   Sensitivity, dB 91   Frequency Response, Hz 20Hz - 20 kHz   Detachable Cable Yes   Stock Cable Material and Length High-purity solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition)   Housing and Headband Materials Aluminum, precious woods, leather   Internal Cup Wiring Custom 2.8mm² solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade high-purity silver   Ear Pads Custom-designed, hand-stitched from genuine leather and fabric (Limited Edition) + Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval   Weight, g 700   Warranty, Months 36 months manufacturer warranty. Optional extended paid warranty available.          Stock: No options  Custom Sound Tuning  Headband customization  Ear cup customization        Stock: No options  High-purity solid-core copper cable  Detachable 1.5mm² custom solid-core hybrid cable: copper + 4N (.999) jewelry-grade silver, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets  Detachable 1.5mm² custom solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade silver cable, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets  Extra set of earpads  Heavy-duty hard-shell case        Stock: Mini Jack 3.5mm Plug  Jack 6.3mm Plug  4.4mm balanced Pentaconn Plug  XLR 4-pin balanced Plug  Dual XLR 3-pin balanced Plugs  Top High-End Plug e.g. Acoustic Revive / Furutech, etc.         
