     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2457724571');});}); #rec2457724571 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457724571 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2457724571 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457724571 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Filin Audio Model 1 Premium v2 Planar Magnetic Closed Headphones Total*: $1900 Buy Now   Perfect Matches These 91dB sensitive planar magnetic closed headphones reveal their true dynamics and holographic imaging with authoritative amplification and high-resolution conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Filin Audio Model 1 Premium v2  +   Gerbera Onda Desktop DAC  +   Demograf Ajax EL-84 Tube Amplifier  +   Konstantin Audio KA-1 Headphone Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF per each item added.     Key Features Specification Tuning & Customization Component Upgrades Cable Output Plug Cable Length      General Description Premium Bundle Includes: solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition), carrying case. 2-year manufacturer's warranty. The Filin Audio "Model 1 Premium" utilizes planar magnetic drivers consisting of a thin membrane with embedded conductive traces, suspended between two arrays of bar magnets. Because the voice coil is evenly distributed across the entire surface of the membrane, it moves uniformly over its entire area during music playback. Unlike traditional dynamic drivers, where the coil only drives the center of the cone, this planar magnetic design ensures highly balanced, flat, and extremely precise audio reproduction without unwanted coloration. Inside these headphones are special membranes crafted by Sergey Snorry, meticulously tuned by master Evgeny Melentiev. Exceptional Passive Noise Isolation! The "Model 1 Premium" features a circumaural (over-ear) monitor design. This is the most sophisticated and advanced headphone form factor, boasting a large headband and fully encompassing ear cups. This allows the integration of a massive membrane that effortlessly reproduces the entire frequency spectrum. The headphones are equipped with planar magnetic drivers engineered and manufactured by Sergey Snorry specifically to Filin Audio's exact specifications, featuring patented tubular waveguide technology (SAW technology®). Inside, the wiring is made of custom 2.8mm² solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade silver, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets. The headphones come with a detachable copper cable to enhance treble and midrange detail, and deliver a punchier bass line. The ear cups are milled from fully dried, premium-grade, ultra-hard exotic woods. Wood waste (sawdust) accounts for about 70%, which serves as a testament to the uncompromisingly strict selection of suitable raw materials. The headphones feature unique, custom-designed ear pads that are entirely hand-stitched. Unique Features & Sound Signature  Internal wiring using custom 2.8mm² solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade high-purity silver. Patented tubular waveguide technology (SAW technology®). Custom planar drivers by Sergey Snorry with significant modifications: enlarged ear cups and driver flanges; center offset forward and downward for perfect ear canal alignment; special tuning via sophisticated acoustic waveguides. Unique tonal balance.  We envision the "Model 1 Premium" as a no-compromise, top-tier High-End audio solution for seasoned audiophiles, yet highly affordable compared to planar magnetic headphones from mainstream renowned brands. The sound signature is highly coherent, open, and textured. The level of resolution and technical performance is outstanding. You get a soundstage comparable to open-back headphones, with none of the typical closed-back issues. The bass extends super low with magnificent control, the treble is completely free of sibilance or harshness, and the midrange timbres are absolutely flawless.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
  The standard configuration (base product) includes the headphones, carrying case, stock solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition) with standard connectors (4-pin XLR output and mini xlr inputs) with no additional options. 
