     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2457782021');});}); #rec2457782021 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457782021 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2457782021 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2457782021 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Filin Audio "Quadron" Planar Magnetic Headphones Total*: $3200 Buy Now   Perfect Matches These 88dB sensitive planar magnetic closed headphones reveal their true dynamics and holographic imaging with authoritative amplification and high-resolution conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Filin Quadron  +   Gerbera Otis Flagship DSD1794 DAC  +   Gerbera Active Tube Preamplifier  +   Konstantin Audio "UN-1" Amplifier  +   Filin Audio the "Purity" Headphone Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF per each item added.     Key Features Specification Tuning & Customization Component Upgrades Cable Output Plug Cable Length      General Description The "Quadron" bundle includes: heavily-protected carrying case, stock solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition), Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval. The Filin Audio "Quadron" headphones utilize planar magnetic drivers consisting of a membrane with thin conductive traces applied to it. The membrane is suspended between two arrays of bar magnets. Because the voice coil is evenly distributed across the entire surface of the membrane, it moves uniformly over its entire area during music playback. In contrast to dynamic drivers, where the coil is attached only to its central part, membrane fluctuations in planar designs are perfectly uniform. Planar magnetic headphones provide a balanced, flat, and extremely precise reproduction of musical material without unwanted sound coloration. Inside these headphones are special membranes crafted by Sergey Glazyrin (snorry), meticulously tuned by master Evgeny Melentiev. Exceptional Passive Noise Isolation! Filin Audio "Quadron" are monitor, circumaural (over-ear) type headphones. This is the most sophisticated and advanced headphone form factor, featuring a large headband and fully encompassing ear cups. These models integrate a massive membrane, allowing them to evenly reproduce the entire frequency spectrum. The Filin Audio "Quadron" headphones are equipped with planar magnetic drivers engineered and manufactured by Sergey Glazyrin (snorry) exactly to Filin Audio's specifications, utilizing tubular waveguide technology (SAW Technology®). The internal wiring of the headphones is executed using custom 2.8mm² solid-core, 4N (.999) jewelry-grade silver, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets. The headphones come with a detachable copper cable to enhance treble and midrange detail, as well as to provide a punchier bass line. The ear cups are milled from fully dried, premium-grade, hard, and expensive exotic woods. Wood waste (sawdust) during the manufacturing process accounts for about 70%, which serves as a testament to the uncompromisingly strict selection of suitable raw materials. The headphones feature unique, custom-designed ear pads that are entirely hand-stitched. The Sound Signature & Vision We envision the Filin Audio "Quadron" headphones as uncompromising, delivering the highest tier of sound for seasoned audiophiles, while remaining highly affordable compared to planar magnetic headphones from mainstream renowned brands.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.   Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section).   Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes the headphones, heavily-protected carrying case, stock solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition) with standard connectors (4-pin XLR output and mini xlr inputs), Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval with no additional options.  Acoustic PrincipleClosed-back Headphones Headphone TypeMonitor Planar Magnetic (Isodynamic) Driver Type and QuantityPlanar Magnetic (Isodynamic), 2 pcs. by Snorry Isodynamic with modifications of Evgeny Melentiev Driver ModificationsEnlarged ear cups and driver flanges; center offset forward and downward for perfect ear canal alignment; special tuning via sophisticated acoustic waveguides High-Tech TechnologiesSAW Technology® Impedance, Ohm40 Sensitivity, dB88 Frequency Response, Hz20Hz - 20 kHz Amplifier requirementsAt least 3W per 40 Ohm. These headphones are highly current-hungry; raw wattage is secondary. Suitable High-Current Amplifiers are e.g. HeadAmp — GS-X MK2 / CFA3 / NAD M2 / Lyngdorf tdai-3400 etc. Detachable CableYes Stock Cable Material and LengthHigh-purity solid-core copper cable (Premium Edition) Housing and Headband MaterialsAluminum, precious woods, leather Internal Cup WiringCustom 2.8mm² solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade high-purity silver Ear PadsCustom-designed, hand-stitched from genuine leather and fabric (Quadron Edition) + Set of Supplementary Acoustic Overlay Earpads for enhanced isolation and detail retrieval Weight, g700 Warranty, Months36 months manufacturer warranty. Optional extended paid warranty available.         Stock: No options  Custom Sound Tuning  Headband customization  Ear cup customization        Stock: No options  High-purity solid-core copper cable  Detachable 1.5mm² custom solid-core hybrid cable: copper + 4N (.999) jewelry-grade siver, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets  Detachable 1.5mm² custom solid-core 4N (.999) jewelry-grade silver cable, uniquely polished and wound around a dielectric in multiple insulating jackets  Extra set of earpads        Stock: Mini Jack 3.5mm Plug  Jack 6.3mm Plug  4.4mm balanced Pentaconn Plug  XLR 4-pin balanced Plug  Dual XLR 3-pin balanced Plugs  Top High-End Plug e.g. Acoustic Revive / Furutech, etc.         
