     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2462136171');});}); #rec2462136171 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462136171 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2462136171 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462136171 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Gerbera Sound A8045 Headphones Tube Amplifier Total*: $1300 Buy Now    Key Features Specification MKI vs MKII Editions Options & Connectors     Purist Single-Ended Topology The core of the A8045 is its purist single-stage, single-ended (SET) architecture. By utilizing 6S15P tubes with exceptionally high transconductance and eliminating the global negative feedback loop entirely, the signal path remains incredibly short. This translates to an immediate, punchy transient response and a holographic soundstage that brings your music to life. Acoustic Signature The A8045 does not strive to be clinically sterile or flatly neutral. It provides a highly engaging, vivid, and lively presentation. Listeners can expect excellent macro-dynamics, a surprisingly deep and articulate bass foundation, and crystal-clear high frequencies that never sound harsh or fatiguing. There are no problematic tonal peaks or dips—just pure musical joy. Premium Internal Components Both the power supply and output stages rely on massive, custom-wound Toroidal (TOR) transformers to ensure quiet operation and excellent channel separation. Despite its compact 190x130x190mm footprint, the amplifier delivers authoritative drive capability for high-end planar magnetic and dynamic headphones alike. Sonically, the amplifier refuses to sound sterile or clinical. It offers superb dynamic range, deep and controlled low frequencies, and pristine, uncompressed highs, rendering a beautifully layered and expansive three-dimensional soundstage with a touch of natural analog warmth. The A8045 is available in two distinct configurations: the purist MKI standard edition, and the vastly upgraded MKII version, which features increased power handling, remote-controlled discrete volume attenuation, and balanced XLR inputs.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the Gerbera Sound A8045 Headphones Tube Amplifier with no additional options Amplifier ClassSingle-Ended Triode (SET), Single-Stage Vacuum Tubes6S15P (6С15П) High-Transconductance Tubes Output Power (MKI)2.0 Watts per channel Output Power (MKII)3.0 Watts per channel Headphone Impedance8 Ohms to 300 Ohms Frequency Response10 Hz – 30 kHz (± 1.0 dB) Global FeedbackZero Global Negative Feedback (No NFB) TransformersCustom Toroidal (TOR) Power & Output Transformers Dimensions (W x H x D)190 x 130 x 190 mm Weight4.5 kg Warranty1 Year Comprehensive Factory Warranty         MKI Standard Edition (2W Output, ALPS Volume, RCA Input)   MKII Upgraded Edition (3W Output, Nikitin Stepped Attenuator + Display/Remote, XLR Input, Tube Mode Switch, 2x Power Transformer)         Standard 6.3mm TRS Headphone Output   Premium 4-Pin XLR Headphone Output Termination   Premium 4.4mm Pentaconn Headphone Output Termination  x1 RCA Input  x1 XLR Input  Premium NOS 6S15P Match-Paired Tube Upgrade       
