     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2463201501');});}); #rec2463201501 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201501 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2463201501 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201501 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          AC Mains Harmonizer Total: $1300 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Model Version      Not Just an EMI Filter It is crucial to understand that this is not a standard EMI (Electromagnetic Interference) filter. It is a specialized Current Harmonic Suppressor. By utilizing a highly sophisticated cascade of resonant LC circuits, the device is precisely tuned to target and eliminate odd current harmonics from the 3rd to the 11th order (specifically 150 Hz, 250 Hz, 350 Hz, and 450 Hz anomalies). Variable Q-Factor Engineering To ensure the device only removes noise and leaves the musical signal untouched, the resonant circuits are designed with varying quality factors (Q-factors). This precise mathematical tuning completely prevents any parasitic resonances or electrical ringing outside of the designated harmonic suppression range. Massive Noise Attenuation The suppression coefficient is incredibly high and scales with your specific electrical conditions. For example, when running a standard 15W high-end load—such as a dedicated digital-to-analog converter (DAC)—the Harmonizer achieves an astonishing harmonic suppression rate of 48 to 50 dB, drastically lowering the system's noise floor. The acoustic result is immediate and profound: bass frequencies become remarkably tight and focused, treble is stripped of all harshness and "dirt," and the overall soundstage depth and spatial layering are dramatically expanded, revealing micro-details previously masked by electrical noise.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
  The standard configuration (base product) includes the stock device with no additional options. 
