o signal from electromagnetic interference, the Attento features a heavy-duty, isolated external power supply equipped with an advanced AC harmonic suppression circuit.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the Gerbera Sound Attento OTL Amplifier with no additional options Amplifier ClassFully Balanced Output Transformerless (OTL) Tube Amplifier Supported HeadphonesElectrostatic Earspeakers (Stax Pro Bias Compatible) Output Tubes6L6GC (Compatible with KT66, EL34, 6P3S, 4654) Driver Tubes6N9S / 6Н9С (Compatible with 6SL7) Maximum Output Voltage600 V Polarization Voltage (Bias)580 V (Stax Pro Bias standard) Input InterfaceBalanced XLR & Unbalanced RCA Output InterfaceStax 5-Pin Teflon Connector Input Impedance50 kOhms Assembly TopologyAuthentic Point-to-Point Hand-Wiring Power SupplyExternal PSU with Active Current Harmonic Suppression Warranty1 Year Comprehensive Factory Warranty         Stock Configuration: 6L6GC + 6N9S Match-Paired Set   Alternate Power Set: Premium KT66 Quad Match   Alternate Power Set: Premium EL34 Quad Match   Vintage NOS Set: Rare 4654 Output Tubes   Driver Tube Upgrade: NOS US-Made 6SL7 Match Pair   x1 RCA Input   x1 XLR Input   x1 Stax Type Output         Standard Edition  Premium Edition       
