ry, and a dead-silent background floor, ensuring that subtle micro-details are perfectly preserved even when using ultra-sensitive headphones. The digital conversion stage is anchored by the highly musical Texas Instruments PCM1794 DAC chip, fed via a premium asynchronous Amanero USB interface that natively supports high-resolution streams up to 32-bit / 384 kHz. To guarantee rock-solid dynamics and a pitch-black background, both the power regulation and output coupling stages utilize custom-wound, over-engineered Toroidal (TOR) transformers. Delivering a massive 3 Watts of pure Class A power to a balanced 4-pin XLR termination, the HA-45 features dedicated switchable output taps tailored perfectly for both low-impedance planar magnetic models (8–100 Ohms) and demanding high-impedance dynamic headphones (100–300 Ohms).         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the Gerbera Sound HA-45 Tube AMP & DAC with no additional options Device TypeArtisan Tube Headphone Amplifier with Integrated DAC Amplifier TopologySingle-Ended (SET), Single-Stage, Point-to-Point Wiring Global FeedbackZero Global Negative Feedback (No NFB) Vacuum Tubes1x 6S45P (6С45П) per channel Integrated DAC ArchitectureTexas Instruments PCM1794 Digital Input InterfaceUSB Asynchronous (Amanero Module) | Up to 32-bit / 384 kHz Analog Input InterfaceUnbalanced RCA (50 kOhm Input Impedance) Headphone OutputBalanced 4-Pin XLR Maximum Output Power3.0 Watts Supported Load ProfilesDual Range Taps: 8–100 Ohms & 100–300 Ohms Frequency Response10 Hz – 20,000 Hz Voltage Gain40 dB TransformersCustom-Wound Toroidal (TOR) Power & Output Transformers Warranty1 Year Comprehensive Factory Warranty         Low-Impedance Optimization Tap (8–100 Ohms)  High-Impedance Optimization Tap (100–300 Ohms)   Dual-Tap Front Mechanical Toggle Switch Install (Both Ranges Active)        Standard Reference Toroidal Core & Stock Tubes  Premium NOS Match-Paired 6S45P Gold-Grid Tube Upgrade )  Additional XLR Output  Additional 6.3 Output  Additional 4.4 Output  XLR Output      
