     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2462136781');});}); #rec2462136781 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462136781 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2462136781 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2462136781 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Gerbera Sound Lira Speaker Tube Amplifier Total*: $1500 Buy Now    Key Features Specification Model Versions Tube Upgrades     Seamless Tube Rolling Capabilities Both versions of the Lira invite you to shape your own sound. Version 1 natively supports swapping the stock 6P3S output tubes for 6L6 or KT66 variants. Version 2 is uniquely engineered to allow direct, adjustment-free swapping from its stock KT66 tubes to highly revered 6S4S (6С4С) Directly Heated Triodes, instantly transforming its acoustic signature. Premium Custom Transformers The heart of the Lira's dynamic capability lies in its custom-wound Toroidal (TOR) power and output transformers. These provide an incredibly wide and linear frequency response, ensuring tight bass control and crystalline high-frequency extension despite the amplifier's compact dimensions. Version 1 pairs a 12AU7 driver stage with 6P3S (6П3С) output tubes, backed by a classic Kenotron power supply. It delivers 2x6 Watts of lush, RMS power with an extended frequency response driven by custom Toroidal (TOR) output transformers. Version 2 takes performance a step further, utilizing a 6G2 (6Г2) driver stage and powerful KT66 output tubes in an ultralinear configuration. This version is built with meticulously selected boutique components (including Wurth, Allen-Bradley, and Jantzen) and allows seamless, plug-and-play swapping to 6S4S (6С4С) Directly Heated Triodes (DHT) without requiring any manual bias adjustments.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the Gerbera Sound Lira Speaker Tube Amplifier with no additional options Amplifier ClassSingle-Ended (SE), Ultralinear Driver Tubes12AU7 (Version 1) / 6G2 (Version 2) Output Tubes6P3S / 6L6 / KT66 (Version 1) | KT66 / 6S4S (Version 2) Output Power (Version 1)2 x 6 W (RMS) Output Power (Version 2)2 x 8 W (KT66) / 2 x 4 W (6S4S DHT) Frequency Response (Version 1)9 Hz – 21 kHz (-3 dB) Frequency Response (Version 2)20 Hz – 20,000 Hz (±0.2 dB Linear) Input Impedance50 kOhm (Version 1) / 100 kOhm (Version 2) Input Sensitivity500 mV (Version 1) / 0.25 V (Version 2) Output Impedance (Load)4 Ohms / 8 Ohms (Rear Panel Switch) Dimensions (W x D x H)320 x 260 x 130 mm Warranty1 Year Comprehensive Factory Warranty         Version 1: 12AU7 Driver + 6P3S Output + Kenotron PSU  Version 2: 6G2 Driver + KT66 Output + Boutique Components (Wurth, Jantzen)        Standard Stock Output Tubes (6P3S for V1 / KT66 for V2)   V1 Only: Upgrade Output to Premium 6L6 Tubes   V1 Only: Upgrade Output to Premium KT66 Tubes  V2 Only: Include matched set of 6S4S (6С4С) Directly Heated Triodes  x1 RCA Input  x1 XLR Input      
