     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2463201471');});}); #rec2463201471 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201471 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2463201471 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201471 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Gerbera Sound "Otis" Series PCM1794 / DSD1794 Flagship DAC Total*: $2500 Buy Now   Perfect Matches This reference DAC architecture is engineered to deliver unmatched musicality and depth. For the ultimate playback presentation, we highly recommend this synergy:   Gerbera Sound "Otis" DAC  +   Art&Air RCA Cables  +   Demograf Icarus AC Power Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF your total order.     Key Features Specification Core Chipset Stage Inputs Components Options Output Stage Aesthetics     Bespoke Relay Bus Switching A defining characteristic of the DSD1794 chipset is its separate physical inputs for DSD and PCM streams. To exploit this architecture without compromising signal integrity, we implemented a mechanical relay-based bus switching array. This completely prevents data cross-degradation, keeping the signal path purist and short. Featuring a specialized relay-based bus switching system to isolate native DSD and PCM data streams alongside an optional outboard tube-rectified (kenotron) power supply, this reference DAC achieves a remarkably organic, live presentation that masterfully balances strict technical precision with pure emotional musicality. Solid Copper Chassis & Maskless PCBs To eliminate stray capacitance and parasitic resonance loops that induce digital glare, the internal circuit boards are manufactured entirely without solder mask. These specialized PCBs are then directly affixed to a heavy, solid-billet copper chassis base, serving as an absolute electrical and mechanical shield. Reference Tube Output Stage The optional analog output stage features four premium, hand-selected EC86 triodes configured with a grounded cathode topology. Operating strictly within the most linear region of their current-voltage characteristics (I/V curve) and completely free from negative feedback (Zero NFB), it provides an exceptionally rich, organic midrange and deep, textured decays. Uncompromised Power Engineering To extract the absolute maximum dynamic range and black backgrounds from the balanced circuit, the system can be configured with an advanced, dual-chassis outboard power supply utilizing full vacuum tube (kenotron) rectification to completely isolate mains interference.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic ConfigurationThe standard configuration (base product) includes the stock product with no additional options. ManufacturerGerbera Sound Device TypeBespoke Reference Stationary Balanced Digital-to-Analog Converter Circuit ArchitectureFully Balanced, Ultra-Short Signal Path, Zero Negative Feedback (Zero NFB) PCB DesignProprietary Maskless Boards mounted on a Resonance-Absorbing Solid Copper Chassis Digital InterfaceXingcore U30 USB Interface (Standard) Format SupportNative DSD up to DSD1024 | PCM up to 32-bit / 1536 kHz Data ManagementMechanical Relay Bus Commutation for isolated DSD/PCM paths Warranty Protection1 Year Comprehensive Manufacturer Warranty         Stock: Balanced PCM1794 Architecture Module  Flagship DSD1794 Architecture Module (Bespoke Relay Bus Commutation)        Stock: Stage I Standard Edition  Stage II Signature Edition  Stage III Reference Edition  Stage IV Premium Edition  Stage V Ultimate        Stock: Xingcore U30 USB Module (Native DSD1024 / PCM 32/1536)  Optional AES/EBU Digital Input Module  Optional Additional Coaxial S/PDIF Digital Input Module  Optional Toslink Optical Digital Input Module        Stock  External Power Supply  Vintage tubes  Pre-Amplifier  Standard XLR Outputs  Premium XLR Outputs  Premium RCA Outputs  Class-A Headphones Amplifier        Stock: Solid State Standard Edition  Solid State Premium Edition  Tube Standard Edition  Tube Premium Edition        Stock: Black Metal Squire Type  Leak Style Wood Edge  Black Glass Type Front Panel      
