     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2463201191');});}); #rec2463201191 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201191 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2463201191 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201191 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Konstantin Audio UN-1 Amplifier Total*: $1900 Buy Now    Key Features Specification     Symmetrical Bridged Class AB By employing a bridged Class AB topology, the UN-1 maximizes voltage swing and raw power delivery. The strict adherence to electrical and physical symmetry throughout the internal layout practically eliminates even-order harmonic distortions, ensuring an incredibly linear, cohesive, and three-dimensional soundstage. Capacitor-Free Power Delivery Standard power supplies rely on blocking capacitors that can inadvertently filter out delicate micro-dynamics. By eliminating them entirely, the UN-1 achieves instantaneous current transfer. Its ability to hold output voltage rock-steady for a full second under a 4A load without mains power guarantees that your woofers remain under total authoritative control at all times. The cornerstone of the UN-1's performance is its revolutionary power supply. It is entirely electrically symmetrical and purposefully designed without a single blocking capacitor.  Uncolored Unity-Gain Preamplification The integrated preamplifier section is designed strictly for attenuation and routing, locked at a maximum unity gain (Gain = 1). This ensures that the original timbral characteristics of your DAC or phono stage are preserved with absolute integrity, passing the pure signal directly to the muscular output stage. The resulting power reserve is staggering: once the main capacitor banks are fully charged, if the power supply is entirely disconnected from the mains, the output voltage remains completely unchanged for a full second even under a heavy 4-Ampere load. This ensures an absolutely constant and stable power delivery to the speakers during the most explosive musical transients.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
  The standard configuration (base product) includes the stock product with no additional options.    
