r selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.   Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section).   Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes The amplifier features RCA inputs, speaker terminals, as well as 6.3mm and XLR headphone outputs, alongside a ground lift switch. It comes in a classic chassis featuring galvanic isolation, power transformers, capacitors, resistors, chokes, and premium wiring for even better sound performance and interference-free operation in the most unstable electrical grids.  Device TypeSolid-State Amplifier Amplifier ClassClass AB Output PowerFrom 25 Watts per channel Speaker Load Impedance8 Ohms (Optional 4 Ohms / 16 Ohms available) TransistorsPremium Toshiba Bipolar Transistors Volume ControlALPS (optionally - Custom Attenuator by Demograf Audio Equipment) Analog InputsUnbalanced RCA | Optional: Balanced XLR Internal WiringProprietary "RareCoreFusion" Alloy wire (other options available) Headphone Outputs6.3mm TRS, 4-Pin XLR | Optional: 4.4mm, 2.5mm, Electrostatic Loudspeaker OutputsStandard Speakers plugs (optionally - Proprietary Demograf Binding Posts) Special FeaturesGround Lift Switch (Defeatable Grounding) Dimensions (W x D x H)From 450 × 400 × 200 mm WeightFrom 15 kg / 33 lbs Limited WarrantyYou can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page         Stock: 25W  50W  75W  100W        Stock: No extra options  Boutique Capacitors Suite (Duelund, Mundorf, Mi