ounce our debut model: the Aura. We spent over six months meticulously engineering the chassis to reduce the weight to an absolute minimum, ensuring the physical ergonomics are finally worthy of the spectacular electrostatic sound. The visual identity of the Aura mirrors its acoustic character: brutal and deeply saturated, yet simultaneously alive, airy, and effortlessly musical. The Aura truly comes alive with high-quality recordings. Whether it is intimate vocals, blues, jazz, or aggressive heavy rock, the presentation makes you feel as though you are standing right in the hall, surrounded by live musicians. After more than six months of meticulous development, Orvellium Nocturne has achieved an almost weightless chassis. The Aura is a visual and tactile masterpiece that perfectly complements its brutal, saturated, yet effortlessly airy and singing sound signature. Whether you are listening to delicate jazz vocals or driving heavy metal, the Aura transports you directly to the live venue. A Complete Ecosystem Orvellium Nocturne is more than just a headphone manufacturer; we are building a complete, harmonized audio ecosystem. Recognizing the need for amplification capable of fully unleashing the Aura's potential, we are concurrently developing a dedicated amplifier and a miniature all-in-one combo unit to serve as the heart of your system. Thanks to their weightless design, the Aura headphones—especially when paired with our upcoming miniature combo—are destined to be your perfect companion on the road, at the office, or in a cafe. We want high-end audiophilia to be accessible, removing the technical barriers between you and the music. Less talk. More music.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calcula