     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2458759891');});}); #rec2458759891 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458759891 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2458759891 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458759891 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Perun Audio Dark Sound mk II Electrostatic Headphones Total*: $990 Buy Now  Perfect Matches These high-sensitivity speakers reveal their true potential with pure Class A single-ended amplification and bit-perfect conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Perun Audio Dark Sound mk II  +   Demograf Audio Tube Multibit DAC  +   Gerbera "Attento" OTL Tube Amplifier  +   Demograf Anthea Headphone Cables  = Ultimate Purity  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF for EACH added device       Key Features Specification      Concept & Amplification The goal of the Perun "Dark Sound mk II" was to challenge the boundaries of electrostatic technology, delivering a visceral bass response comparable to top-tier planar magnetic headphones, without losing the breathtaking, natural transparency across the frequency range. It is no secret that electrostatic headphones demand exceptional amplification. When paired with high-end amplifiers—such as those from Demograf Audio—these headphones scale magnificently, uncovering massive potential and multidimensional soundstage depth. Advanced Stator & Bone Conduction Bass Through extensive acoustic R&D, the ear cups were minimized in size while preserving the full surface area of the membrane. Instead of relying on multi-way or isobaric designs, the breakthrough lies in a highly complex stator featuring varying zones of acoustic transparency. By combining perforated fiberglass and fine bronze mesh, the stator offers restricted airflow for deep bass resonance and high transparency for the mids and highs. This proprietary driver is mounted directly to the earpad via a rigid armature ring. This unique rigid coupling acts as an auxiliary tactile receptor, transferring low-frequency resonances directly to the listener's skull via bone conduction. While subtle, this effect makes drums and bass lines incredibly impactful and tactile—an achievement virtually unheard of in electrostatic headphones. Features an incredibly complex custom stator, an innovative bone-conduction bass transfer system, and an ultra-lightweight AKG K1000-inspired headband. Ergonomics & Sound Signature Inspired by the iconic AKG K1000, the minimalist wire headband utilizes a single spring mechanism with two degrees of freedom (vertical and horizontal), perfectly adapting to any head shape. The earpads are low-profile and dense, crafted from thin 0.4mm premium goatskin, layered with furniture-grade foam and a ribbon of memory foam. This design also creates a slight gap at the bottom, lending the headphones an incredibly "open" and spacious speaker-like presentation. The sound signature features exceptionally dense, hard-hitting bass and perfectly even midranges without the frequency dips common in traditional headphones. The treble is flawlessly smooth, entirely devoid of sibilant peaks or harshness. The result is a highly saturated, voluminous sound with multi-layered depth that will satisfy lovers of all genres, including heavy metal.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
