     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2456677111');});}); #rec2456677111 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2456677111 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2456677111 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2456677111 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Perun Elder Floorstanding Electrostatic Two-way Open Full-range Active Loudspeakers Total*: $25000 Buy Now  Perfect Matches These flagship speakers reveal their true potential with vintage vynil roll-type turntable such as Garrard 401 with Brave Beetle or Gerbera Phonostage & TwinMono DST or TZAR DST Cartridge. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Perun Elder  +   Tzar DST Cartridge  +   Brave Beetle Talisman Balanced MM/MC Phonostage  +   Konstantin Audio A-1 Speaker Cables  = Ultimate Purity  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF for EACH added device       Key Features Specification Stage Bi-amping / Bi-wiring Crossover options Preamplifier options Aesthetics     Ultra-Thin 2-Micron Membrane The core of the system relies on a specialized 2-micron membrane treated with a proprietary conductive coating. This virtually massless radiating surface provides transient speeds and micro-detail retrieval that traditional dynamic drivers simply cannot physically match. True Electrostatic Isobaric Bass The most unique feature of the Perun is its low-frequency reproduction. The MF/LF section uses an isobaric configuration with 6 membranes sandwiched between 8 solid 3mm steel stators. This allows for deep, tactile, and lightning-fast bass down to 20 Hz, completely avoiding the sluggishness of typical hybrid dynamic woofers. External Analog Studio Crossover The system can be equipped with an external studio-grade analog crossover and active preamplifier (volume control) from Demograf Audio. Unlike traditional filters, this external unit allows for precise cutoff adjustments without rotating the phase, completely eliminating the typical 2–5 kHz crossover dip/peak. Active Class-D Amplification The system is passive type in stock but each section can be optionally powered by a dedicated Class-D amplifier module engineered specifically for the Perun by Demograf Audio (4 amplification modules in total).         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
