 preamplifier (volume control) from Demograf Audio. Unlike traditional passive crossover filters, this external unit allows for precise cutoff adjustments without rotating the phase, ensuring a seamless blend between the electrostatic panel and the dynamic subwoofer without the typical 2–5 kHz crossover dip/peak. Active Class-D Amplification Electrostatic speakers require high voltage, not current. Therefore, each section is powered by a dedicated Class-D amplifier module engineered specifically for the Perun by Demograf Audio (2 amplification modules in total: one for the HF/MF membrane, one for the subwoofer). Custom step-up transformers (wound in Australia) and a 5000V multiplier system feed the signal instantly to the panels.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
