     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2458760671');});}); #rec2458760671 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458760671 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2458760671 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458760671 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          Perun Modern MK II Electrostatic Headphones Total*: $1450 Buy Now  Perfect Matches These high-sensitivity ES Headphones reveal their true potential with pure Class A single-ended amplification and bit-perfect conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   Perun Modern MK II  +   Gerbera Otis DSD1794 DAC  +   Gerbera "Attento" OTL Amplifier  = Ultimate Purity  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF for EACH added device       Key Features Specification      Acoustic Concept & Amplification The core objective of the Perun Modern MK II was to engineer an electrostatic headphone capable of replicating the absolute authority, punch, and sub-bass texture found in flagship planar magnetic models, while preserving the natural, unmatched transparency inherent to electrostatic speed. These ultra-resolving drivers scale flawlessly when paired with ultra-high-end amplification, such as Demograf Audio Equipment, completely unlocking a multi-layered, deep, and spacious holographic soundstage. Advanced Heterogeneous Stator & Tactile Bass Ring To maximize acoustic intensity while keeping the ear cup dimensions tight, the driver eliminates multi-way and isobaric configurations in favor of an intricate, uncompromised single-membrane stator system. The customized stator features varying acoustic transparency zones: a denser perforated glass-textolite substrate handles low-frequency resonance, while a fine bronze mesh maximizes mid and high-frequency dispersion. This effectively kills two birds with one stone, delivering thunderous bass extension alongside pure, uncolored upper frequencies. Furthermore, the driver is rigidly coupled to the earpads via a structural ring armature—a proprietary know-how known as the "Perun Dark Sound" concept. This mechanical coupling intentionally transfers low-frequency vibrations directly to the listener's skull via bone conduction. Similar to the experiential tactile sensations of Flatvox headphones available in our showroom, this physical resonance turns sub-bass transients and percussive drum hits into an incredibly punchy, visceral experience that acts as a secondary sensory receptor alongside traditional hearing. Features an advanced, dual-material complex stator design, a proprietary tactile bone-conduction ring, and a highly articulating custom headband architecture. AKG K1000 Inspiration & Perfect Linear Tuning The ultra-lightweight wire frame structure was heavily inspired by the legendary AKG K1000. It utilizes a singular spring mechanism optimized to create a slight gap at the lower edge of the earpads, ensuring a spacious, speaker-like open presentation. Because the low-profile 0.4mm goatskin and memory foam pads are structurally firm to support the bone conduction ring, the mechanical headband adds two distinct axes of freedom (vertical and horizontal alignment) to perfectly compensate for individual head contours. Subjectively, the sound signature provides extremely rock-solid, impactful low frequencies. Unlike typical headphones, the midrange is flat and smooth, completely devoid of frequency response "pockets" or artificial dips. The top-end registers remain impeccably linear, showing absolutely no sibilant peaks or harsh, standard hiss artifacts commonly observed in competing high-end alternatives like Abyss or top-tier Stax models. The resulting sound is immensely saturated, voluminous, and incredibly dense—making it a perfect endgame choice even for demanding heavy metal fans. Note on Lineup Positioning: Following the transition from Perun Live Sound to the current Perun Dark Sound, the architectural difference between the Dark Sound series and the square-profile Perun Modern line (which succeeded the Perun Ultimate / Rock Sound series) remains entirely a matter of aesthetic preference and specific tonal signature seasoning.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
