dio—these headphones uncover vast technical potential, presenting a deeply voluminous soundstage and striking holographic imaging. Advanced Stator & Tactile Bone-Conduction Ring Through exhaustive physical testing, the ear cup dimensions were minimized while maintaining the massive surface area of the primary membrane. Eliminating complex multi-way or isobaric designs, the core engineering utilizes an intricate single-membrane stator with varying zones of acoustic transparency. Perforated fiberglass sections provide ideal acoustic loading for thunderous low frequencies, while a fine woven bronze mesh guarantees maximized upper-mid and high-frequency dispersion. This effectively kills two birds with one stone. To further elevate presentation, the driver is anchored to the earpads through a structural armature ring. This proprietary know-how mechanically guides the low-frequency vibrations directly to the listener's skull via bone conduction. Acting as an auxiliary tactile receptor alongside your traditional hearing, this system leverages the fact that deep sub-bass is naturally perceived by the skeleton. The result is an incredibly tactile, heavy-hitting bass response that delivers physical impact — an achievement virtually unheard of in closed electrostatic headphones. Features an advanced multi-zone stator design, custom exotic wood cups optimized for high acoustic loading, and an innovative bone-conduction bass transfer system

AKG K1000 Inspiration & Perfect Linear Tuning The architectural wire frame layout draws inspiration from the iconic AKG K1000. It utilizes a single spring configuration designed to create an intentional micro-gap at the lower rim of the earpads, allowing a closed-back system to breathe with an incredibly spacious, speaker-like open presentation. Since the low-profile earpads are structurally firm to anchor the bone conduction ring, the mechanical headband introduces two distinct axes of freedom (vertical and horizontal alignment) to perfectly self-adjust to individual head contours. The pads are tightly stitched from premium 0.4mm goatskin leather, filled with furniture-grade foam and a thin ribbon of high-density memory foam. Subjectively, the tuning yields a remarkably solid, rock-hard low-frequency control. The midrange remains perfectly linear, completely devoid of artificial frequency "pockets" or the acoustic dips common in standard headphones. The high frequencies extend flawlessly without sibilant peaks or annoying background hiss, delivering an immensely saturated, textured soundstage that will thoroughly captivate lovers of all genres, including demanding heavy metal enthusiasts.          Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
