lly improve elastic isotropy and enhance membrane behavior during sudden, high-volume transient peaks. The MK-3 generation introduces a highly refined photolithography manufacturing process, featuring significantly thinner trace geometries that effectively eliminate current-density distortion and optimize magnetic field alignment. Housed in a newly optimized, vibration-dampening structural ABS composite chassis, the Trion MK-3 offers flawless transient speed, monumental headroom, and an incredibly textured, layered presentation of musical images. Advanced Acoustic & Material Optimization The headphone cups are milled from a premium composite blending metal and a highly specialized structural ABS plastic selected for its supreme vibration-dampening properties. Additionally, the MK-3 features completely redesigned earpads integrated with a specialized cloth grill that provides superior dust and hair protection for the sensitive matrix membrane without altering high-frequency performance. Internal wiring also transitions to a purist, audiophile-preferred paper insulation оболочка instead of standard silicone.         Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
  The standard configuration (base product) includes the headphones, sc-2 cable by snorry with standard connectors (4-pin XLR output and mini xlr inputs) and protection case with no additional options. 
