     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2463201511');});}); #rec2463201511 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201511 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2463201511 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2463201511 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          L. Sinitsyn Master Cartridge Collection Total*: $3500 Buy Now   Perfect Matches This reference custom MC cartridge is engineered to extract maximum micro-dynamics and holographic soundstage from your vinyl playback system. For the ultimate analog presentation, we highly recommend this synergy:   MC Cartridge  +   Vintage Retro Vynil Turntable e.g. Micro Seiki SX-8000  +   Demograf Ulixes Solid-State Phonostage  +   Art&Air Phono Cables  = Ultimate Synergy  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF your total order.     Select Model Key Features Specification Body & Aesthetics     Select Cartridge Architecture & Coil Core Choose the foundational engine of your cartridge. The Tzar DST offers direct-to-diamond scaling, while the TwinMono series specializes in crosstalk eradication.   TwinMono Standard: Pure Copper Coils / 32 Ohm Stereo   TwinMono Silver SE: Pure Silver Coils / 10 Ohm Stereo   Tzar DST Stereo: Ultra-Proximity Neumann Architecture Stereo MC  Tzar DST Mono: High-Expression Neumann Architecture Mono MC         The collection allows you to select between two distinct, proprietary engineering architectures: the innovative TwinMono stereo series, which utilizes spatially isolated dual-mono bobbins to achieve an unprecedented 45dB of channel separation, and the world-famous Tzar DST line, a direct homage to the Neumann blueprint that mounts voice coils directly to the diamond tip to permanently shatter "cantilever fog."  The TwinMono Concept: Total Channel Isolation The core innovation of the TwinMono lies in its structural layout: the voice coils are wound on entirely independent frames and spatially isolated from one another. Linked via a proprietary mechanical matrix, mechanical modulation within one channel remains completely localized, leaving the opposite coil entirely at rest. This eliminates cross-channel leakage and cross-talk modulation, delivering a monumental, industry-leading 45dB of channel separation at 1000 Hz. Subjectively, the tuning yields an incredibly comfortable, non-fatiguing sound signature across all genres. It features an authoritatively extended low-frequency register paired with highly delicate, silky highs completely devoid of artificial sibilance or shouty midrange peaks.   The Tzar DST Concept: Shattering the "Cantilever Fog" The Tzar DST is a direct homage to the mythical Neumann DST moving coil design. Traditional MC cartridges position their voice coils at the far end of the cantilever tube, allowing structural bending and tube resonances to blur micro-details. The Tzar DST mounts its voice coils directly adjacent to the diamond stylus crystal. By virtually bypassing the cantilever's length footprint, it completely eliminates "cantilever fog" and material colorations. Praised heavily by Stereophile Magazine, the Tzar DST creates a dense, highly tactile soundstage with convex, three-dimensional sonic objects. Note decays continue for immense durations, filling the stage with real room acoustics. It represents an enchanting presentation akin to virtual reality.   Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message. Lead Times You can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration The standard configuration (base product) includes the stock device only with no additional options. Limited Warranty You can find information about Warranty by visiting Warranty & Returns Policy page           Metric Specification TwinMono Series Tzar DST Series    Transducer TypeMoving Coil (MC)Moving Coil (MC) Design FootprintBespoke Dual-Mono ArmatureUltra-Proximity Neumann Topology Channel SeparationBreathtaking 45 dB at 1 kHzReference Holographic Staging Output Voltage0.35 mVReference Macro Dynamics Internal Impedance32 Ohms (Copper) / 10 Ohms (Silver)Ultra-Low Transducer Resistance Cantilever / InterfaceProprietary Connected MatrixHigh-Rigidity Carbon / Direct-to-Tip Cartridge Weight14 gramsOptimized High-Mass Shell Tracking Force Range3.5 – 4.0 gramsReference Mechanical Loading Stylus Profile0.6 mil Conical MatrixSelected Line-Contact / Micro-Diamond        Bespoke Body Material & Finish Options * Please note: For the TwinMono line, you can select premium exotic wood or composite bodies. For the Tzar DST line, the body configuration is traditionally fixed to optimized, high-rigidity enclosures required by Neumann mechanics (select 'Standard' below if ordering Tzar DST).   Standard Factory Body (Exotic Cocobolo Wood / Tzar Fixed Armor)   Stabilized American Walnut Root Wood Body (TwinMono Only)   Polished White Corian Composite Solid Body (TwinMono Only)       
