     t_onReady(function() {t_onFuncLoad('t491_init',function() {t491_init('2458759921');});}); #rec2458759921 .t-card__title{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458759921 .t-card__title{font-size:14px;}}#rec2458759921 .t-card__descr{font-size:20px;font-family:var(--t-text-font,Arial);}@media screen and (max-width:480px),(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:480px){#rec2458759921 .t-card__descr{font-size:14px;}}          VOLGA-TONE "PRIBOI-1 Planar Magnetic Headphones Total*: $950 Buy Now  Perfect Matches These high-sensitivity speakers reveal their true potential with pure Class A single-ended amplification and bit-perfect conversion. To achieve the ultimate transparent presentation, we recommend this synergy:   VOLGA-TONE "PRIBOI-1  +   Gerbera TV-LPF PCM-DSD DAC  +   Demograf "Nemesis" Solid-state Amplifier  +   Konstantin Audio KA-1 Headphones Cable  = Ultimate Purity  Add recommended synergy components to get 5% OFF for EACH added device       Key Features Specification      Advanced Planar Technology At the heart of the PRIBOI-1 lies a proprietary magneto-planar driver engineered with a high-density magnetic field and an expanded effective working surface. A heavy-duty array of 44 magnets forms a powerful, uniform magnetic system, ensuring absolute, rigid control over the membrane's movement. The high-impedance membrane features an optimized conductive trace topology to push tracking accuracy to its absolute limit. Furthermore, direct silver-bearing solder connections are used on the membrane, completely eliminating degradation and the negative resonances associated with traditional pressure-fit contacts. The massive 48 mm x 58 mm transducer size yields a deep, authoritative, and physically palpable low-frequency presentation. This is a tier of engineering where the driver does not simply "play sound" — it reconstructs its entire physical structure with instantaneous transient response, ultra-low distortion, and zero parasitic resonances. Uncompromised Sound Signature The PRIBOI-1 establishes a direct, intimate contact between the listener and the master recording. The bass extends incredibly deep and fast, maintained by strict control without a trace of bloating or bleed. The midrange is completely open, transparent, and vivid, presenting flawless timbre accuracy — especially on vocals. The high frequencies are remarkably clean and extended, completely free of artificial sharpness or glare. Boasting a total harmonic distortion level of less than 0.01%, these headphones preserve pure micro-dynamics and micro-details. You do not hear an interpretation; you hear the original master file. Professional Construction & Signal Chain The PRIBOI-1 seamlessly merges industrial engineering with everyday practical utility. It features a circumaural, acoustically open-back architecture equipped with precision-machined headband adjustment mechanics and professional-grade MiniXLR termination blocks. The system fully unlocks its high-end potential when driven via a fully balanced signal chain, which delivers superior channel separation, improved dynamics, and ultimate driver control. The stock bundle includes interchangeable 4.4mm balanced and 3.5mm single-ended connection options. Thermal Stability Control As a highly sensitive, ultra-precise electro-acoustic system, the PRIBOI-1 reaches its ideal working parameters when exposed to normal body heat. It operates within an optimal internal temperature window of +25°C to +40°C. This behavior is not a technical limitation — it is the hallmark of a high-fidelity reference system calibrated to perform at extreme tolerances. Target Positioning The PRIBOI-1 does not try to please the listener with artificial colorations. It exposes the recording exactly as it is. It is the definitive choice for:  Professional studio monitoring and mastering Critical, analytical listening sessions Audiophiles demanding the absolute limit of reference fidelity           Total Price* The price is for the base product only and does not include shipping or selected optional upgrades. To get a complete final quote, please submit your request to our consultant via email at shop@filinlabs.com or via Telegram at @RA_Fayzullin. We will send you an invoice & full costs calculation in the reply message.  Lead TimesYou can check the lead times for each item in the "Lead Times & Handcrafted Quality" section. If the standard waiting time does not suit you, you can request our expedited assembly service (for details, see the "Priority Assembly Option" section). We also remind you that installment payment options are available for any product (see the "Installments" section). Basic Configuration
  The standard configuration (base product) includes the headphones, detachable cable (4.4 Pentaconn, 3.5 mini Jack, 6.3 Jack TRS outputs and mini xlr inputs), heavily-protected carrying case with no additional options. 
